 <h3><u>Zaamin hai Imame Reza</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Ya sayyadi ya maulayi<br> Ya imam e reza</p> 
  <p>Ae ehle aza fi amanir-reza..(2)<br> mash'had se sada dete hai ye imam e reza..ae ehle aza<br> bazu pe agar baandh lo taweez e reza<br> zamin hai imam e reza..(3)</p> 
  <p>1. Ye rasm nahi qaul hai ye (maula reza ka)..(2)<br> sikka nahi taweez hai ye (radde bala ka)..(2)<br> mushkil hi nahi raah se tal jae qaza..ae ehle aza</p> 
  <p>2. Maa behno ko bacho ko (pehnao ye sikka)..(2)<br> aur malise shabbir me (batwao ye sikka)..(2)<br> banjaoge batil ke liye behre khuda..ae ehle aza</p> 
  <p>3. Hoga na koi khauf (balao ka kabhi bhi)..(2)<br> tootega yazeedo ka bharam (dekhna khudhi)..(2)<br> khud maut pilaegi tumhe aabe baqa..ae ehle aza</p> 
  <p>4. Taweez e reza ho ya (alamdaar ka parcham)..(2)<br> dono hi mita dete hai (taqdeer ke sab ghum)..(2)<br> ghaazi ka alam dega tumhe khud hi dua..ae ehle aza</p> 
  <p>5. Taboot uthe jab bhi kahi (maula reza ka)..(2)<br> taboot se taweez (dua karke uthana)..(2)<br> jo mangoge us waqt tumhe dega khuda.. ae ehle aza</p> 
  <p>6. Har daur me har nasl me (raej ho ye sikka)..(2)<br> jo nasl abhi aengi (uska ho ye wirsa)..(2)<br> khatoone qayamat bhi tumhe dengi dua..ae ehle aza</p> 
  <p>7. Dete raho pursa, mazloom raza ka<br> masooma e qum bhi talabgaar hai<br> zakhmi hai kaleja, kuch to ho dilasa<br> wo bibi abhi tak dilafgaar hai<br> us dil ko isi tarha suku aaega..ae ehle aza</p> 
  <p>8. Ek farsh bichao, logo ko bulao<br> aur padhke masaeb karo ye buka<br> jab zehre sitam ne, dil kar diya tukde<br> duniya se sidhara wo maula mera<br> tukdo me bata qalb simat jaega..ae ehle aza</p> 
  <p>9. Haan mazhar o irfaan, karte raho aelaan<br> duniya ko batao haqeeqat hai kya<br> darain ke sardaar, hai maliko mukhtaar<br> maula mere sarkaar imam e reza<br> tum inke zamanat me rahoge sadaa..ae ehle aza</p> 
  <p></p> 
